{"page":219,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:89","surah":10,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ قَدْ أُجِيبَت دَّعْوَتُكُمَا فَٱسْتَقِيمَا وَلَا تَتَّبِعَآنِّ سَبِيلَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God said, ‘Your prayers are answered, so stay on the right course, and do not follow the path of those who do not know.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُجِيبَت","en_gloss":"has been answered","transliteration":"ujībat","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دَّعْوَتُكُمَا","en_gloss":"(the) invocation of both of you","transliteration":"daʿwatukumā","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَٱسْتَقِيمَا","en_gloss":"So you two (keep to the) straight way","transliteration":"fa-is'taqīmā","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَتَّبِعَآنِّ","en_gloss":"follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿānni","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَبِيلَ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīla","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"10:89"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٩","en_gloss":"(89)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:89"}]},{"verse_key":"10:90","surah":10,"ayah":90,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَجَـٰوَزْنَا بِبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱلْبَحْرَ فَأَتْبَعَهُمْ فِرْعَوْنُ وَجُنُودُهُۥ بَغْيًا وَعَدْوًا ۖ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَآ أَدْرَكَهُ ٱلْغَرَقُ قَالَ ءَامَنتُ أَنَّهُۥ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِىٓ ءَامَنَتْ بِهِۦ بَنُوٓا۟ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ وَأَنَا۠ مِنَ ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We took the Children of Israel across the sea. Pharaoh and his troops pursued them in arrogance and aggression. But as he was drowning he cried, ‘I believe there is no God except the one the Children of Israel believe in. I submit to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَجَـٰوَزْنَا","en_gloss":"And We took across","transliteration":"wajāwaznā","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) Children","transliteration":"bibanī","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(of) Israel ","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرَ","en_gloss":"the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥra","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَأَتْبَعَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and followed them","transliteration":"fa-atbaʿahum","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِرْعَوْنُ","en_gloss":"Firaun","transliteration":"fir'ʿawnu","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجُنُودُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and his hosts","transliteration":"wajunūduhu","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَغْيًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) rebellion","transliteration":"baghyan","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَعَدْوًا ۖ","en_gloss":"and enmity","transliteration":"waʿadwan","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِذَآ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَدْرَكَهُ","en_gloss":"overtook him","transliteration":"adrakahu","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْغَرَقُ","en_gloss":"the drowning","transliteration":"l-gharaqu","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ءَامَنتُ","en_gloss":"I believe","transliteration":"āmantu","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"annahu","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"the One","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ءَامَنَتْ","en_gloss":"in Whom believe","transliteration":"āmanat","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in Whom believe","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":23,"ar":"بَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"the Children of Israel","transliteration":"banū","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":24,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"the Children of Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":25,"ar":"وَأَنَا۠","en_gloss":"and I am","transliteration":"wa-anā","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":26,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"the Muslims","transliteration":"l-mus'limīna","verse_key":"10:90"},{"pos":28,"ar":"٩٠","en_gloss":"(90)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:90"}]},{"verse_key":"10:91","surah":10,"ayah":91,"ar_uthmani":"ءَآلْـَٔـٰنَ وَقَدْ عَصَيْتَ قَبْلُ وَكُنتَ مِنَ ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘Now? When you had always been a rebel, and a troublemaker!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ءَآلْـَٔـٰنَ","en_gloss":"Now","transliteration":"āl'āna","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"waqad","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَصَيْتَ","en_gloss":"you (had) disobeyed","transliteration":"ʿaṣayta","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَكُنتَ","en_gloss":"and you were","transliteration":"wakunta","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","en_gloss":"the corrupters","transliteration":"l-muf'sidīna","verse_key":"10:91"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٩١","en_gloss":"(91)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:91"}]},{"verse_key":"10:92","surah":10,"ayah":92,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ نُنَجِّيكَ بِبَدَنِكَ لِتَكُونَ لِمَنْ خَلْفَكَ ءَايَةً ۚ وَإِنَّ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ عَنْ ءَايَـٰتِنَا لَغَـٰفِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Today We shall save only your corpse as a sign to all posterity. A great many people fail to heed Our signs.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"So today","transliteration":"fal-yawma","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُنَجِّيكَ","en_gloss":"We will save you","transliteration":"nunajjīka","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِبَدَنِكَ","en_gloss":"in your body","transliteration":"bibadanika","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِتَكُونَ","en_gloss":"that you may be","transliteration":"litakūna","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِمَنْ","en_gloss":"for (those) who","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلْفَكَ","en_gloss":"succeed you","transliteration":"khalfaka","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَايَةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"a sign","transliteration":"āyatan","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"āyātinā","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَغَـٰفِلُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) surely heedless","transliteration":"laghāfilūna","verse_key":"10:92"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٩٢","en_gloss":"(92)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"10:92"}]},{"verse_key":"10:93","surah":10,"ayah":93,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ بَوَّأْنَا بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ مُبَوَّأَ صِدْقٍ وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم مِّنَ ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ فَمَا ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْعِلْمُ ۚ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ يَقْضِى بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فِيمَا كَانُوا۟ فِيهِ يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We settled the Children of Israel in a good place and provided good things as sustenance for them. It was only after knowledge had come to them that they began to differ among themselves. Your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection regarding their differences.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَوَّأْنَا","en_gloss":"We settled","transliteration":"bawwanā","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) Children","transliteration":"banī","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(of) Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُبَوَّأَ","en_gloss":"(in) a settlement","transliteration":"mubawwa-a","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":6,"ar":"صِدْقٍۢ","en_gloss":"honorable","transliteration":"ṣid'qin","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"and We provided them","transliteration":"warazaqnāhum","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the good things","transliteration":"l-ṭayibāti","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","en_gloss":"they differ","transliteration":"ikh'talafū","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahumu","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمُ ۚ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'mu","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"10:93"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَقْضِى","en_gloss":"will judge","t